    "system": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "45 days. Structured inquiry. A self you recognise at the end of it.",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The journal moves through four phases. The first is excavation \u2014 identifying what has been buried and where it came from. The second is examination \u2014 looking at it clearly, without judgment. The third is integration \u2014 bringing those parts back into your sense of self. The fourth is expression \u2014 living as the whole version of you, not the curated one.</p><p>One prompt per day. 10 to 20 minutes. A process that does not require you to have it figured out before you begin.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading",
        "text"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "container_type": "container",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 40,
        "mobile_padding_top": 30,
        "mobile_padding_bottom": 30
      }
    },
    "accountability": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p>You do not do this alone.</p>",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A signed commitment. An accountability partner who knows you are doing this work. Because the parts of yourself you are reclaiming have been hidden for a reason \u2014 and having someone witness the process is part of what makes it real.</p>",
            "nav_check_list": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading",
        "text"
      ],
